                                "sense_id": "ba4beade-c2a5-3731-b08e-8daca7762d59",
                                "text": "Emily Arundel stood by the dressing-table. The last curl of her dark hair had received its last braid of pearls; the professor of papillotes had decided, and she quite agreed with him, that à la Calypso best suited with her Grecian style of feature."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "22962a85-53c8-44da-af4e-ad8be54bdafe",
                                "sense_id": "ba4beade-c2a5-3731-b08e-8daca7762d59",
                                "text": "\"Good heavens, what has happened!\" thought Glorvina, trembling with all the papillotes."
                            }
                        ]
